    "image_path": "images/slide_02.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "给读者的话\n为什么红、黄、蓝三位小色啦，在新被套里睡\n了一夜，就变了颜色？\n对，黑色啦染布技术不高，他染的布都掉色。\n可是，你注意了吗？他们都变成了什么颜色？\n红色啦睡蓝被套变成了紫色。\n蓝色啦睡黄被套变成了绿色。\n黄色啦睡红被套变成了橙色。\n原来，红、黄、蓝叫三原色。\n红加蓝变紫，蓝加黄变绿，黄加红变橙。\n紫、绿、橙叫三间色。\n这个小故事会让你牢牢记住三原色是怎样变成\n三间色的。",
    "page_text_en": "A Message to the Reader\nWhy did the three little colors—red, yellow, and blue—change color after sleeping in the new duvet cover for one night?\nBecause Black Color's dyeing skills are not good; the cloth he dyed all fades.\nBut did you notice? What colors did they become?\nRed Color slept in the blue duvet cover and turned purple.\nBlue Color slept in the yellow duvet cover and turned green.\nYellow Color slept in the red duvet cover and turned orange.\nOriginally, red, yellow, and blue are called primary colors.\nRed plus blue becomes purple, blue plus yellow becomes green, yellow plus red becomes orange.\nPurple, green, and orange are called secondary colors.\nThis little story will help you remember how primary colors turn into secondary colors.",
    "summary_zh": "本页是绘本的导读页，解释了红、黄、蓝三位小色啦因睡在不同颜色的被套中而变色的现象，借此科普三原色混合成三间色的色彩知识。"
  },
