    "image_path": "images/slide_18.png",
    "page_text_ocr_zh": "毛毛虫美育馆\n《新被套》延伸美术活动\n调颜料水\n黑色啦学染布，我们来学调漂亮的颜料水。\n材料准备：\n无色透明饮料瓶三个、水粉颜料（红黄蓝）、\n一次性透明杯。\n1.在三个饮料瓶盖子里分别装上适量红、黄、蓝颜料。（图1）\n（小贴士：如果想要变色效果明显，请选择玫红、柠檬黄、湖蓝颜料。）\n2.每个瓶子都灌入半瓶水，然后盖上盖子用力上下摇瓶子。（图2与2-1任选）\n3.三原色果汁调出来了，把调好的果汁倒入透明杯。（图3与3-1任选）",
    "page_text_en": "Mao Mao Chong Art Gallery\nExtension Art Activity for 'New Duvet Cover'\nMixing Paint Water\nBlackie is learning to dye fabric, let's learn to mix beautiful paint water.\nMaterials needed:\nThree colorless transparent drink bottles, watercolor paints (red, yellow, blue),\nDisposable transparent cups.\n1. Put an appropriate amount of red, yellow, and blue paint into the caps of three drink bottles. (Figure 1)\n(Tip: If you want the color-changing effect to be obvious, choose magenta, lemon yellow, and lake blue paints.)\n2. Pour half a bottle of water into each bottle, then put on the cap and shake the bottle up and down vigorously. (Choose either Figure 2 or 2-1)\n3. The three primary color juices are mixed, pour the mixed juice into transparent cups. (Choose either Figure 3 or 3-1)",
    "summary_zh": "本页介绍了一个名为“调颜料水”的美术活动，指导孩子使用饮料瓶、水粉颜料和透明杯，通过在瓶盖中加入颜料、加水摇晃、再倒入杯中的步骤，学习调制三原色颜料水，并配有操作步骤的图片示例。"
  },
