    "page_text_ocr_zh": "（小贴士：根据颜色为果汁取好听的名字，如“草莓汁”、“柠檬汁”、“蓝莓汁”等。）\n4. 将饮料瓶里多余的颜料水倒入不同色的半杯颜料水里，会调出什么新色颜料水呢？（图4-5）\n（小贴士：给新的颜料水取名，如“橙汁”、“葡萄汁”、“青苹果汁”等。小朋友如果喜欢把所有的颜料水混合在一起，就让他们放开手脚玩吧，不要介意调出一大杯浓浓的咖啡色颜料水哦。图6）",
    "page_text_en": "（Tip: Give the colored juice nice names based on their colors, such as \"strawberry juice\", \"lemon juice\", \"blueberry juice\", etc.）\n4. Pour the leftover paint water from the drink bottle into half-filled cups of different colored paint water. What new colors will you create? (Figure 4-5)\n（Tip: Name the new paint water, such as \"orange juice\", \"grape juice\", \"green apple juice\", etc. If children like to mix all the paint water together, let them play freely. Don't mind if they end up with a big cup of dark coffee-colored paint water. Figure 6）",
